{"code":"S12","wikidata":"Q18162596","wikipedia":{"en":"Bang Wa station","th":"สถานีบางหว้า"},"summary":{"en":"Bang Wa station is a rapid transit station on the BTS Silom Line and MRT Blue Line in Pak Khlong Phasi Charoen Subdistrict, Phasi Charoen District, Bangkok, Thailand. The station is on the Phet Kasem Interchange where Ratchaphruek cuts with Phet Kasem Roads. It serves as an interchange station for BTS Silom Line and MRT Blue Line, providing direct interchange, but with separate fare and ticket systems for the two lines.","th":"สถานีบางหว้า เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าในเขตภาษีเจริญ กรุงเทพมหานคร ในเส้นทาง"},"opened":"2013-12-05","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/BTS_Bang_Wa_stn.JPG/960px-BTS_Bang_Wa_stn.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:BTS_Bang_Wa_stn.JPG","author":"暇・カキコ","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/201701_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/201701_Concourse_of_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Concourse_of_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Concourse_of_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/201701_Platforms_of_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Platforms_of_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Platforms_of_Bang_Wa_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.